      "statement": "Talon's WhatsApp channel defaults to 'self' exposure (paired account only), and enabling 'open' exposure to arbitrary senders requires an explicit acknowledgement env var because such senders run with the operator's model credentials, channel credentials, MCP tool access, and local-host access.",
