      "id": "claim_25bc2e75a3994d85ae82a1dab384ba73",
      "statement": "dcode routes both TUI and non-interactive execution through a local langgraph dev subprocess that binds 127.0.0.1 with LANGGRAPH_AUTH_TYPE=noop, so there is no server authentication and any localhost process that discovers the ephemeral port can submit requests, read thread state, or inject messages; loopback binding is the containment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
